diff -ruN '--exclude=CHANGES_FROM_*.patch' '--exclude=FILE_MANIFEST.txt' brd_v114_orig/BRD_BLE_OLED/BLE_API_V1.14.txt brd_v115_work/BRD_BLE_OLED/BLE_API_V1.14.txt
--- brd_v114_orig/BRD_BLE_OLED/BLE_API_V1.14.txt	2026-09-14 05:35:42.000000000 +0000
+++ brd_v115_work/BRD_BLE_OLED/BLE_API_V1.14.txt	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
@@ -1,514 +0,0 @@
-BRD_BLE_OLED V1.14
-BRD Reliable BLE Protocol V3
-BLE API Specification
-========================================
-
-1. BLE Device
-----------------------------------------
-Device Name:
-BRD_XXXX
-
-XXXX = ESP32-C3 MCU ID 最後 4 碼 HEX
-
-BLE Settings:
-MTU         = 23
-Max Payload = 20 bytes
-TX Power    = -6 dBm
-Byte Order  = Little-endian
-
-
-2. GATT UUID
-----------------------------------------
-Service:
-7f510001-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
-
-0002 Data Notify:
-7f510002-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
-Property: READ / NOTIFY
-Packets : 0x81, B1, B2, A1, A2, A3, A4
-
-0003 Control:
-7f510003-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
-Property: WRITE
-Commands: C1, C2, C3, C4, C5
-
-0004 Firmware Revision:
-7f510004-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
-Property: READ
-Response: V1.14
-
-0005 Diagnostic:
-7f510005-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
-Property: READ
-
-V1.14 已移除 V1.12/V1.13 的 0006 State READ / INDICATE Characteristic。
-App 不需要訂閱 0006。
-
-
-3. App Connection Flow
-----------------------------------------
-1. Scan BRD_XXXX
-2. Connect
-3. Discover Service 0001
-4. Subscribe 0002 Notification
-5. Read 0004 Firmware Revision
-6. 等待 0002 傳入 0x81 Current State Snapshot
-7. 進入正常操作
-
-BLE Disconnect 狀態只能依手機 Native BLE Connection Event 判斷。
-不可因一段時間沒有 B1 / 0x81 就自行判定斷線。
-
-
-4. 0x81 STATE
-----------------------------------------
-Direction:
-Device -> App
-
-Characteristic:
-0002
-
-Type:
-NOTIFY
-
-Length:
-5 bytes
-
-Format:
-Byte 0      = 0x81
-Byte 1      = State
-Byte 2      = Flags
-Byte 3      = state_seq Low
-Byte 4      = state_seq High
-
-State:
-0 = WAIT_LOAD
-1 = LOADED_READY
-2 = SPINNING_LOADED
-3 = SPINNING_LAUNCHED
-4 = RESULT_PENDING
-
-Flags:
-bit0 = Loaded
-bit1 = Active / Spinning
-bit2 = Launch Valid
-bit3 = Result Pending
-bit4 = Charging
-bit5 = WAIT_ACK
-bit6 = Reserved
-bit7 = Reserved
-
-state_seq:
-uint16 little-endian
-每次 State 或 Flags 真正改變時 +1。
-允許 65535 -> 0 rollover。
-新連線 Snapshot 本身不增加 state_seq。
-
-
-5. LOAD READY Reliable Notify - V1.14 主要修改
-----------------------------------------
-LOAD LOW -> HIGH
--> LOAD debounce 完成
--> State = LOADED_READY
--> state_seq 更新
--> Device 發送 0x81 LOADED_READY
--> 每 200 ms 重送同一個目前 LOADED_READY state_seq
--> 直到 App 回傳 C5 ACK
--> ACK 正確後停止 READY 重送
-
-重要：
-- 沒有 ACK timeout。
-- 沒有 State timeout。
-- 沒有 Indication / ATT Confirmation。
-- 沒有因 READY ACK 遺失而主動 Disconnect。
-- App 可以晚一點 ACK；Device 會繼續重送 READY。
-
-如果 READY 尚未 ACK，但實際狀態已變成 SPINNING / WAIT_LOAD / 其他 State：
-- 舊 READY 重送立即停止。
-- 舊 C5 ACK 之後到達會被忽略。
-- 不會阻止量測。
-
-如果 BLE 自然斷線後重新連線，而且 Device 當下仍是 LOADED_READY：
-- App 訂閱 0002 後 Device 重新送 State Snapshot。
-- READY 再次每 200 ms 重送，直到收到對應 C5。
-
-
-6. C5 LOAD READY ACK
-----------------------------------------
-Direction:
-App -> Device
-
-Characteristic:
-0003 WRITE
-
-Length:
-4 bytes
-
-Format:
-Byte 0      = 0xC5
-Byte 1      = State
-Byte 2      = state_seq Low
-Byte 3      = state_seq High
-
-有效 ACK 必須同時符合：
-State == 1 (LOADED_READY)
-state_seq == Device 目前 LOADED_READY state_seq
-Device 目前仍為 LOADED_READY
-Device 目前仍在等待 READY ACK
-
-Example:
-Device -> App:
-81 01 01 25 00
-
-代表：
-State = LOADED_READY
-Flags = 0x01
-state_seq = 0x0025 = 37
-
-App -> Device:
-C5 01 25 00
-
-正確後 Device 停止重送 READY。
-
-錯誤或舊的 state_seq：
-- Device 忽略 ACK。
-- READY 繼續重送。
-- 不斷線。
-
-C5 沒有 A4 Response。
-停止收到相同 READY 重送即可視為 Device 已接受 C5。
-
-
-7. 其他 0x81 State Event
-----------------------------------------
-除 LOADED_READY 外，其餘狀態：
-- State / Flags 改變時送一次 0x81 Notify。
-- 不要求 C5 ACK。
-- 新連線訂閱 0002 後會送一次目前 State Snapshot。
-
-App 應永遠以最新的 0x81 State 為目前 Device State。
-state_seq 跳號時可記錄診斷，但不要猜測漏掉的中間 State。
-
-
-8. B1 LIVE
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: Device -> App
-Characteristic: 0002 NOTIFY
-Length: 13 bytes
-
-Offset  Size  Field
-0       1     0xB1
-1       1     State
-2       1     Flags
-3       2     Current RPM
-5       2     Max RPM
-7       2     Launch RPM
-9       2     Curve Duration ms
-11      2     Curve Sample Count
-
-B1 只在 SPINNING 狀態使用，約每 200 ms 更新。
-B1 不是 BLE heartbeat。
-WAIT_LOAD / LOADED_READY 不要求週期 B1。
-
-正式 State 以 0x81 為主。
-
-
-9. B2 LAUNCH
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: Device -> App
-Characteristic: 0002 NOTIFY
-Length: 9 bytes
-
-Offset  Size  Field
-0       1     0xB2
-1       2     Launch RPM
-3       2     Max RPM at Launch
-5       2     Launch Time ms
-7       2     Launch Sample Index
-
-V1.13/V1.14 RPM 採 Rising + Falling 雙邊沿，但每筆 RPM 仍由同極性完整 360 度週期計算。
-App 不需要知道 Edge 類型，也不要自行重算 Launch RPM。
-
-
-10. A1 CURVE START
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: Device -> App
-Characteristic: 0002 NOTIFY
-Length: 20 bytes
-
-Offset  Size  Field
-0       1     0xA1
-1       2     Sample Count
-3       2     Sample Interval (Event Curve 固定 0)
-5       2     Duration ms
-7       2     Max RPM
-9       2     Launch RPM
-11      2     Launch Time ms
-13      2     Launch Sample Index
-15      1     Flags
-16      2     Max RPM Time ms
-18      2     Session
-
-Flags:
-bit0 = Launch Valid
-bit1 = Curve Complete
-bit2 = Event Curve Format
-
-
-11. A2 CURVE DATA
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: Device -> App
-Characteristic: 0002 NOTIFY
-
-Byte 0      = 0xA2
-Byte 1      = N (1~4 samples)
-Byte 2..3   = Packet Index
-Byte 4..    = Samples
-
-Each Sample = 4 bytes:
-uint16 Time_ms
-uint16 RPM
-
-第一筆固定：
-Time = 0 ms
-RPM  = 0
-
-V1.14 曲線 RPM sample 來源維持 V1.13 雙邊沿完整一圈量測。
-App parser 不需分辨 Rising / Falling。
-
-
-12. A3 CURVE END
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: Device -> App
-Characteristic: 0002 NOTIFY
-Length: 11 bytes
-
-Offset  Size  Field
-0       1     0xA3
-1       2     Session
-3       2     Packet Count
-5       2     Sample Count
-7       4     CRC32
-
-
-13. CRC32
-----------------------------------------
-CRC-32 / ISO-HDLC
-
-CRC Input:
-依 Sample 順序對每筆原始 4 bytes 計算：
-Time_L
-Time_H
-RPM_L
-RPM_H
-
-包含第一筆 0 ms / 0 RPM。
-
-
-14. A4 STATUS
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: Device -> App
-Characteristic: 0002 NOTIFY
-Length: 6 bytes
-
-Offset  Size  Field
-0       1     0xA4
-1       2     Session
-3       1     Status
-4       2     Detail
-
-Status:
-0x00 = ACK Accepted
-0x01 = Selective Retransmission Accepted
-0x02 = Full Retransmission Accepted
-0x03 = Abort Accepted
-0x80 = Session Mismatch
-0x81 = Packet Index Invalid
-0x82 = Command Format Invalid
-0x83 = Sample Count Mismatch
-0x84 = CRC Mismatch
-0x85 = No Result
-0x86 = ACK Window Invalid / Expired
-
-注意：
-A4 Status code 0x81 與 Packet Type 0x81 位於不同欄位，不衝突。
-
-
-15. C1 CURVE ACK
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: App -> Device
-Characteristic: 0003 WRITE
-Length: 9 bytes
-
-Byte 0      = 0xC1
-Byte 1..2   = Session
-Byte 3..4   = Sample Count
-Byte 5..8   = CRC32
-
-全部正確且在 WAIT_ACK window 內才接受。
-成功後 Device 發 A4 Status 0x00。
-
-
-16. C2 SELECTIVE RETRANSMISSION
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: App -> Device
-Characteristic: 0003 WRITE
-
-Format:
-0xC2
-uint16 Session
-uint8 Count
-uint16 PacketIndex[Count]
-
-Count = 0~8
-Count = 0 表示只重送 A3 END。
-
-成功後 Device 發 A4 Status 0x01，接著重送指定 A2 + A3。
-
-
-17. C3 FULL RETRANSMISSION
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: App -> Device
-Characteristic: 0003 WRITE
-Length: 3 bytes
-
-0xC3
-uint16 Session
-
-Session = 0xFFFF 可要求目前保存的結果完整重傳。
-成功後 Device 發 A4 Status 0x02，再重送 A1/A2/A3。
-
-
-18. C4 ABORT
-----------------------------------------
-Direction: App -> Device
-Characteristic: 0003 WRITE
-Length: 3 bytes
-
-0xC4
-uint16 Session
-
-成功後 Device 發 A4 Status 0x03，並清除 RAM Curve。
-OLED MAX 顯示不受影響。
-
-
-19. Timeout / Retry
-----------------------------------------
-LOAD READY:
-BLE_LOAD_READY_INTERVAL_MS = 200 ms
-沒有 ACK timeout
-沒有斷線 recovery
-收到正確 C5 才停止，或 Device State 離開 LOADED_READY 時停止
-
-Curve:
-BLE_PACKET_INTERVAL_MS = 8 ms
-BLE_SEND_TIMEOUT_MS    = 5000 ms
-BLE_ACK_RETRY_MS       = 1000 ms
-BLE_ACK_TIMEOUT_MS     = 5000 ms
-BLE_STATUS_TIMEOUT_MS  = 2000 ms
-
-Curve timeout 只改變 Curve transaction state，不主動斷開 BLE Connection。
-
-
-20. Firmware 不主動斷線規則
-----------------------------------------
-V1.14 BLE protocol flow 不使用任何主動 disconnect() recovery。
-
-以下狀況都不會因 protocol timeout 主動斷線：
-- LOAD READY 沒收到 C5
-- C5 state_seq 錯誤
-- State Notify 送失敗
-- Curve Send Timeout
-- Curve ACK Timeout
-- A4 Status Timeout
-
-如果 Native BLE Connection 真正斷線，Device 被動處理並重新 Advertising。
-
-注意：裝置低電停用 BLE 或進入 Deep-sleep 時會關閉 BLE stack，實體連線自然會結束；這屬於電源管理，不是 protocol recovery disconnect。
-
-
-21. Diagnostic API
-----------------------------------------
-UUID:
-7f510005-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
-
-Property: READ
-Length: 20 bytes
-
-Offset  Size  Field
-0       1     Protocol Version = 3
-1       1     TX State
-2       1     Flags
-3       1     Reliable Mode = 1
-4       2     Current Result Session
-6       2     Sample Count
-8       4     CRC32
-12      2     Duration ms
-14      2     Command Errors
-16      2     Notify Failures
-18      2     ACK Timeouts
-
-TX State:
-0 = IDLE
-1 = START
-2 = DATA
-3 = END
-4 = WAIT_ACK
-5 = DONE
-6 = TIMEOUT
-
-
-22. Recommended App Flow
-----------------------------------------
-Connect
--> Subscribe 0002 Notify
--> Read 0004 Firmware Version
--> Receive 0x81 State Snapshot
-
-WAIT_LOAD:
-0x81 WAIT_LOAD once
-
-LOAD completed:
-0x81 LOADED_READY every 200 ms
--> App immediately updates UI READY
--> App writes C5 with same State + state_seq
--> Device stops READY resend
-
-Spin starts before ACK:
-Device leaves LOADED_READY
--> READY resend stops automatically
--> latest 0x81 State wins
--> stale C5 is ignored
-
-SPINNING:
-0x81 SPINNING event
-+B1 every 200 ms
-
-LAUNCH:
-B2 LAUNCH
-+0x81 SPINNING_LAUNCHED event
-
-RESULT:
-0x81 RESULT_PENDING
-+A1/A2/A3 reliable curve
--> verify packet count/sample count/CRC
--> C1 ACK / C2 / C3 / C4
-
-
-23. App Rules
-----------------------------------------
-- 不訂閱 0006；V1.14 已移除。
-- 只需 Subscribe 0002 Notify。
-- 收到 LOADED_READY 後必須回 C5。
-- C5 必須使用收到的同一個 state_seq。
-- 重複 READY 封包可以重複回相同 C5，安全。
-- 不要用「沒有 B1」判斷斷線。
-- BLE Connection 只依 Native BLE Connected/Disconnected Event。
-- App 永遠以最新 0x81 State 為準。
-- B1 只做即時 RPM。
-- B2 的 Launch RPM 與 Device MAX 為正式量測值。
-- Curve 仍須做 CRC / Packet Index / ACK。
-
-========================================
-Firmware: BRD_BLE_OLED V1.14
-Protocol: BRD Reliable BLE Protocol V3
-========================================
diff -ruN '--exclude=CHANGES_FROM_*.patch' '--exclude=FILE_MANIFEST.txt' brd_v114_orig/BRD_BLE_OLED/BLE_API_V1.15.txt brd_v115_work/BRD_BLE_OLED/BLE_API_V1.15.txt
--- brd_v114_orig/BRD_BLE_OLED/BLE_API_V1.15.txt	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ brd_v115_work/BRD_BLE_OLED/BLE_API_V1.15.txt	2026-09-14 06:03:31.501563235 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,474 @@
+BRD_BLE_OLED V1.15
+BRD Reliable BLE Protocol V4
+BLE API Specification
+============================================================
+
+1. BLE Device
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Device Name:
+BRD_XXXX
+
+XXXX = ESP32-C3 MCU ID 最後 4 碼 HEX
+
+BLE Settings:
+MTU         = 23
+Max Payload = 20 bytes
+TX Power    = -6 dBm
+Byte Order  = Little-endian
+
+
+2. GATT UUID
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Service UUID:
+7f510001-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
+
+0002 Data Characteristic:
+7f510002-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
+Property: READ / NOTIFY
+Packets: B1 / B2 / A1 / A2 / A3 / A4
+
+0003 Control Characteristic:
+7f510003-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
+Property: WRITE
+Commands: C1 / C2 / C3 / C4
+
+0004 Firmware Revision Characteristic:
+7f510004-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
+Property: READ
+Response: V1.15
+
+0005 Diagnostic Characteristic:
+7f510005-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
+Property: READ
+Protocol Version: 4
+
+V1.15 沒有 0006 State Characteristic。
+
+
+3. V1.15 狀態同步修改
+------------------------------------------------------------
+V1.14 的以下機制全部移除：
+
+0x81 STATE
+C5 STATE_ACK
+state_seq
+LOAD READY pending
+READY ACK retry/確認流程
+
+V1.15 改回 B1 LIVE 每 200 ms 持續發送。
+
+只要：
+- BLE Connected
+- App 已訂閱 0002 Notify
+
+Device 就會持續送出 B1。
+
+WAIT_LOAD、LOADED_READY、SPINNING、RESULT_PENDING 都會送。
+
+App 不需要對 READY 回 ACK。
+App 不需要保存 state_seq。
+App 不需要處理 0x81。
+App 不需要送 C5。
+
+單筆 B1 掉包時不需補傳，下一筆 200 ms Snapshot 會再次帶回完整 State / Flags。
+
+
+4. B1 LIVE
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction:
+Device -> App
+
+Characteristic:
+0002
+
+Type:
+NOTIFY
+
+Cadence:
+200 ms
+
+Length:
+13 bytes
+
+Format:
+Offset  Size  Field
+0       1     0xB1
+1       1     State
+2       1     Flags
+3       2     Current RPM
+5       2     Max RPM
+7       2     Launch RPM
+9       2     Curve Duration ms
+11      2     Curve Sample Count
+
+State:
+0 = WAIT_LOAD
+1 = LOADED_READY
+2 = SPINNING_LOADED
+3 = SPINNING_LAUNCHED
+4 = RESULT_PENDING
+
+Flags:
+bit0 = Loaded
+bit1 = Active / Spinning
+bit2 = Launch Valid
+bit3 = Result Pending
+bit4 = Charging
+bit5 = WAIT_ACK
+bit6 = Reserved
+bit7 = Reserved
+
+App 使用規則：
+每收到 B1，直接以最新 State / Flags 覆蓋本地裝置狀態。
+不要把 B1 當成需要逐筆保存的事件。
+不要對 B1 回 ACK。
+
+
+5. LOAD Flow
+------------------------------------------------------------
+WAIT_LOAD:
+Device 持續每 200 ms 發：
+B1 State=WAIT_LOAD
+
+LOAD LOW -> HIGH 且通過韌體 debounce：
+State -> LOADED_READY
+
+之後 Device 持續每 200 ms 發：
+B1 State=LOADED_READY
+Flags bit0 Loaded = 1
+
+保持裝載時不需要任何 App ACK。
+
+開始旋轉：
+State -> SPINNING_LOADED
+B1 持續每 200 ms 發送，並更新 Current RPM。
+
+發射：
+State -> SPINNING_LAUNCHED
+Device 送一次 B2 LAUNCH，B1 仍持續每 200 ms同步狀態。
+
+量測完成 / Result Pending：
+State -> RESULT_PENDING
+B1 仍持續每 200 ms同步狀態。
+
+
+6. B2 LAUNCH
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction:
+Device -> App
+
+Characteristic:
+0002
+
+Type:
+NOTIFY
+
+Length:
+9 bytes
+
+Format:
+Offset  Size  Field
+0       1     0xB2
+1       2     Launch RPM
+3       2     Max RPM at Launch
+5       2     Launch Time ms
+7       2     Launch Sample Index
+
+V1.13 起 Launch RPM 使用最新 Rising/Falling 同極性完整一圈 RPM。
+App 直接使用 Device 傳回的 Launch RPM，不自行從 B1 重算。
+
+
+7. A1 CURVE START
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction: Device -> App
+Type: NOTIFY
+Length: 20 bytes
+
+Offset  Size  Field
+0       1     0xA1
+1       2     Sample Count
+3       2     Sample Interval (=0, Event Curve)
+5       2     Duration ms
+7       2     Max RPM
+9       2     Launch RPM
+11      2     Launch Time ms
+13      2     Launch Sample Index
+15      1     Flags
+16      2     Max RPM Time ms
+18      2     Session
+
+A1 Flags:
+bit0 = Launch Valid
+bit1 = Curve Complete
+bit2 = Event Curve Format
+
+
+8. A2 CURVE DATA
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction: Device -> App
+Type: NOTIFY
+
+Header:
+Byte 0    = 0xA2
+Byte 1    = N (1~4 samples)
+Byte 2..3 = Packet Index LE16
+Byte 4..  = Samples
+
+Each Sample = 4 bytes:
+uint16 Time_ms
+uint16 RPM
+
+V1.15 第一筆仍固定：
+Time_ms = 0
+RPM     = 0
+
+V1.13 起 sample 來源為 Rising/Falling 兩組交錯的完整 360 度 RPM。
+App 不需要知道 Edge polarity。
+
+
+9. A3 CURVE END
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction: Device -> App
+Type: NOTIFY
+Length: 11 bytes
+
+Offset  Size  Field
+0       1     0xA3
+1       2     Session
+3       2     Packet Count
+5       2     Sample Count
+7       4     CRC32
+
+
+10. CRC32
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Algorithm:
+CRC-32 / ISO-HDLC
+
+CRC Input:
+每一筆 Sample 依序使用：
+Time_L
+Time_H
+RPM_L
+RPM_H
+
+CRC 包含第一筆 0 ms / 0 RPM。
+
+
+11. C1 ACK
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction: App -> Device
+Characteristic: 0003
+Length: 9 bytes
+
+Byte 0    = 0xC1
+Byte 1..2 = Session
+Byte 3..4 = Sample Count
+Byte 5..8 = CRC32
+
+完整驗證成功後才送 C1。
+
+
+12. C2 Selective Retransmission
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction: App -> Device
+Characteristic: 0003
+
+Format:
+0xC2
+uint16 Session
+uint8 Count
+uint16 PacketIndex[Count]
+
+Count = 0~8
+Count = 0 表示只要求重送 A3。
+
+
+13. C3 Full Retransmission
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction: App -> Device
+Characteristic: 0003
+Length: 3 bytes
+
+0xC3
+uint16 Session
+
+Session 0xFFFF 可要求目前保存結果完整重傳。
+
+
+14. C4 Abort
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction: App -> Device
+Characteristic: 0003
+Length: 3 bytes
+
+0xC4
+uint16 Session
+
+
+15. A4 STATUS
+------------------------------------------------------------
+Direction: Device -> App
+Characteristic: 0002
+Type: NOTIFY
+Length: 6 bytes
+
+Offset  Size  Field
+0       1     0xA4
+1       2     Session
+3       1     Status
+4       2     Detail
+
+Status:
+0x00 = ACK Accepted
+0x01 = Selective Retransmission Accepted
+0x02 = Full Retransmission Accepted
+0x03 = Abort Accepted
+0x80 = Session Mismatch
+0x81 = Packet Index Invalid
+0x82 = Command Format Invalid
+0x83 = Sample Count Mismatch
+0x84 = CRC Mismatch
+0x85 = No Result
+0x86 = ACK Window Invalid / Expired
+
+注意：A4 的 Status Code 0x81 是「Packet Index Invalid」，與已移除的舊 0x81 STATE Packet 無關。
