+17. 不主動斷線原則
+------------------------------------------------------------
+V1.15 BLE protocol 不因以下情況主動呼叫 disconnect():
+
+- B1 Notify failure
+- Curve Notify failure
+- Curve Send timeout
+- ACK timeout
+- A4 Status timeout
+- 未知/錯誤 Control command
+
+低電模式或 Deep-sleep 需要停止 BLE stack 時，實體連線仍會自然結束；這是電源管理，不是 protocol recovery disconnect。
