+1       1     TX State
+2       1     Flags
+3       1     Reliable Mode
+4       2     Current Result Session
+6       2     Sample Count
+8       4     CRC32
+12      2     Duration ms
+14      2     Command Errors
+16      2     Notify Failures
+18      2     ACK Timeouts
+
+TX State:
+0 = IDLE
+1 = START
+2 = DATA
+3 = END
+4 = WAIT_ACK
+5 = DONE
+6 = TIMEOUT
+
